00:04:38.000 --> 00:04:58.000
So it was not such a tremendous surprise. The other interesting thing though is that in Bogota, the mom had been told she was having identical twins, and this might have been information gotten from an early scan as possible. But it could be that, you know, sometimes these things can be unreliable, and so when she had fraternal twin boys,
所以这并不算太大的意外。不过另一个有趣的事情是，在波哥大，那位母亲被告知她怀的是同卵双胞胎，这可能是从早期扫描中获得的信息。但也有可能，你知道，有时这些事情可能不可靠，所以当她生下异卵双胞胎男孩时，

