she accepted it and was quite pleased. William and Wilbur, the two brothers who grew up in the farming village, eventually moved to Bogota and get jobs behind the counter at a butcher shop. It's the summer of 2013, they're now 25. And it's here where their lives begin to intersect with the brothers in the city, Jorge and Carlos, where it starts to become clear that someone, somehow, has made a terrible mistake. A coworker of Jorge, again, one of the twins raised in the city,
她接受了，并且非常高兴。威廉和威尔伯，这对在农村长大的兄弟，最终搬到了波哥大，在一家肉铺柜台后面找到了工作。那是2013年的夏天，他们现在25岁了。正是在这里，他们的生活开始与城里的兄弟豪尔赫和卡洛斯产生交集，也正是在这里，事情开始变得清晰：有人，以某种方式，犯了一个可怕的错误。豪尔赫的一位同事，也就是在城里长大的双胞胎之一，

