runs into William at the Buche Shop. One day, two women went to the Butcher Shop to buy some meat. Now, one of those women was a coworker of Jorge's. And her first impulse was, what is Jorge doing behind the Butcher counter? Is he moonlighting as a Butcher on weekends as he's short of money? And she was really baffled when he didn't greet her. Meanwhile, the friend that she was with said, don't be silly, that is my boyfriend's cousin. So they're going back and forth, back and forth on this.
在肉铺遇到了威廉。有一天，两名妇女去肉铺买肉。其中一名妇女是豪尔赫的同事。她的第一反应是，豪尔赫在肉铺柜台后面干什么？他周末缺钱在做兼职屠夫吗？当他没有向她打招呼时，她真的感到很困惑。与此同时，她身边的朋友说，别傻了，那是我男朋友的表弟。所以她们就这个问题反复争论。

