Jorge and William look exactly the same. Another friend breaks the ice. William is wider, he says. But other than their complexion, they are like mirror images. Both handsome with delicate features. Both have an easy laugh. They steal glances at each other and shift from side to side. Oh my God says their friend. This can be true.
豪尔赫和威廉长得一模一样。另一位朋友打破了僵局。威廉更宽一些，他说。但除了肤色，他们就像镜子里的影像。两人都长相英俊，五官精致。两人都有爽朗的笑声。他们偷看对方，左右摇摆。天哪，他们的朋友说。这怎么可能。

