Jorge says I can't believe it. To an onlooker, this moment would look like nothing. Just young men joking around. It's meaning would sink in only later. I'm so glad to have you here. But right now, they have so many questions. William and Jorge go to a nearby coffee shop where they find they have instant chemistry. They got along well. They understood the world the same way.
豪尔赫说我不敢相信。对于旁观者来说，这一刻看起来没什么特别。只是年轻人在开玩笑。它的意义只有后来才会显现。我很高兴见到你。但现在，他们有太多的问题。威廉和豪尔赫去了附近的一家咖啡馆，发现他们之间有瞬间的化学反应。他们相处得很好。他们以同样的方式理解世界。

