And that was something rare for them because neither one of them shared it with their fraternal twin, they're so called fraternal twin brother. Up next would be the reunion of the other identical twin pair, Carlos and Wilbur. And here's something I've left out of the story. Wilbur was also at the square that night, watching from the sidelines. It was decided then and there that he should meet his identical twin Carlos as soon as possible. The three young men get in a cab to go find Carlos. The reunion is hard for Carlos. It meant he was supposed to have grown up on a farm, not a city.
这对他们来说是罕见的，因为他们都没有与他们的异卵双胞胎，也就是所谓的异卵双胞胎兄弟分享过这种感觉。接下来是另一对同卵双胞胎卡洛斯和威尔伯的重聚。这里有一件事我没讲。那天晚上威尔伯也在广场，在场边观看。当时就决定他应该尽快见到他的同卵双胞胎卡洛斯。这三个年轻人打了一辆出租车去寻找卡洛斯。重聚对卡洛斯来说很艰难。这意味着他本应该在农场长大，而不是在城市。

