It meant his brother was not his real brother. His sister was not his real sister. His mother was not his real mother. Because you've got to remember that Carlos was a city boy. He loved his mother who would pass away a few years earlier and to discover that she might not be his mother was absolutely devastating to him. The first time he saw his identical brother Wilbur, Carlos went out of his way to try and
这意味着他的兄弟不是他真正的兄弟。他的姐妹不是他真正的姐妹。他的母亲不是他真正的母亲。因为你必须记住，卡洛斯是个城市男孩。他深爱着几年前去世的母亲，发现她可能不是自己的亲生母亲对他来说是绝对毁灭性的打击。他第一次见到同卵兄弟威尔伯时，卡洛斯竭尽全力试图

